            "review_title": "Review at Banh Mi Hong Hoa",
            "review_text": "kaenhu\nAustin, Texas256 contributions\n0\nAwesome bánh mì and friendly staff.\nApr 2026 • Solo\nGreat bánh mì. I usually get the thít nường in the US but I got the #1, all the cold cuts plus the homemade pate. Everything was delicious and the serving size for the small is just right. You can get a big one too. I went back again. Can definitely sit on the tiny tables/chairs and people watch, always fun and when they are busy, they try to accommodate and bring out more tiny tables and chairs. Busy enough to let you know this place is good, but never a super long line when I was there. Cash only. May try going again before I go home.\nRead more\nWritten April 25, 2026",
