            "review_text": "extravelagent\nHonolulu, Hawaii444 contributions\n0\nGreat bahn mis *updated March 2024\nOct 2023 • Solo\nWanted to check this place out since I love bahn mis and of course Mark Weins had visited. It's a nice little joint! I ordered their pork bahn mi and they had me sit down. While waiting I watched the Saigon world go by so it was fun. It also started to train so their umbrellas came in handy. My bahm mi shortly came and realize I ordered the wrong one. Still at the pork meatballs of goodness but it gave me an excuse the come back the next day before my flight. Initially I came around 7p for dinner, no line at all. I went back the next day for their traditional pork around 10am and no line either. I guess I got luck both times. Great bahn mis with super nice bread for under $2. Must go!\n***update March 2024- tried it again. Still good and still like that I can sit in their little chairs out front. SO good and still a great price! Go early for the roast poek or they run out by night time!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nDine in so you can watch the locals stop just to get the bread hahaha!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten March 18, 2024",
